# Line endings.
#
# Every text file here is already stored with LF endings, so nothing in this
# file changes the current content; it stops a future checkout from changing it.
# core.autocrlf rewrites files on the way out, and the files below cannot
# survive that: LICENSE and NOTICE are compared byte for byte against the
# upstream corpus and they travel inside the skill folder, where a rewritten
# character would be a changed licence.
* text=auto

LICENSE                     text eol=lf
NOTICE                      text eol=lf
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md      text eol=lf
llm-privacy-gateway/LICENSE text eol=lf
llm-privacy-gateway/NOTICE  text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted, and must never be diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary

# Diagrams are text and diff usefully, but keep them LF like everything else.
*.svg  text eol=lf
